      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The word \"detemmienation\" in this message is a combination of the word \"determination\" - a key term in Underta/e's story - and the name \"Temmie\".",
        "raw": "The word \"detemmienation\" in this message is a combination of the word\n\"determination\" - a key term in Underta/e's story - and the name \"Temmie\".",
