    {
      "id": "p0174-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "If the player refuses to give Temmie Flakes to a Temmie in battle, Temmie says \"can't blame a BARK for tryin' ...\" in English as a funny tune plays. In his notes, Toby explained this line and his vision for the Japanese equivalent:",
        "raw": "If the player refuses to give Temmie Flakes to a Temmie in battle, Temmie says\n\"can't blame a BARK for tryin' ...\" in English as a funny tune plays. In his notes,\nToby explained this line and his vision for the Japanese equivalent:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
