    {
      "id": "p0174-b010",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "'' Pretty much a meaningless/nonsense phrase, though the idea is \"you can't blame me for trying (to get those temmie flakes).\" temmie makes a special face during this action. Honestly it might be interesting if this was completely changed, including her face,for absolutely no reason, as one of those translation mysteries like, if her face became very manly and she just says \"You have entered the pit ofh ell ...\"",
        "raw": "'' Pretty much a meaningless/nonsense phrase, though the idea is \"you\ncan't blame me for trying (to get those temmie flakes).\" temmie makes a\nspecial face during this action. Honestly it might be interesting if this was\ncompletely changed, including her face,for absolutely no reason, as one of\nthose translation mysteries like, if her face became very manly and she just\nsays \"You have entered the pit ofh ell ...\"",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
